This is magnificent.

57
00:01:49.981 --> 00:01:52.575
Get in there, get in there, get in there.

58
00:01:52.575 --> 00:01:53.429
Oh yeah!

59
00:01:53.429 --> 00:01:55.096
Oh yeah!
Oh yeah!

60
00:01:56.695 --> 00:01:57.945
I also have a--

