74
00:02:21.025 --> 00:02:21.858
Viva Mexico!

75
00:02:21.858 --> 00:02:24.025
Viva Mexico City! Salud!

76
00:02:26.122 --> 00:02:28.824
Now, I wanna ask you, Diego,

77
00:02:28.824 --> 00:02:30.410
this is fascinating to me,

78
00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.997
you got your start in telenovelas--

79
00:02:32.997 --> 00:02:33.830
